"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The US military responded strongly to Iran's attack on US bases in Jordan. The kingdom now has to decide whether to continue retaliating or try to calm the situation.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Military Response\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ej\u00e9rcito de EE.UU. respondi\u00f3 fuerte al ataque de Ir\u00e1n a bases en Jordania. El reino ahora debe decidir si sigue atacando o trata de calmar la situaci\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Respuesta Militar de EE.UU.\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Gale-force winds on Crete have caused fires, leading to the evacuation of several villages. Firefighters are also dealing with fires in the Gironde region, where some locals have not evacuated despite the 40C heat.\",            \"english_title\": \"Fires in Crete and Gironde\",            \"translated_version\": \"Vientos fuertes en Creta han causado incendios, llevando a evacuar varios pueblos. Bomberos tambi\u00e9n luchan contra incendios en la regi\u00f3n de Gironda, donde algunas personas no han evacuado a pesar del calor de 40 grados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incendios en Creta y Gironda\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The country's eSafety commissioner claims that Telegram did not remove videos of mass shootings.\",            \"english_title\": \"Telegram and Videos\",            \"translated_version\": \"El comisionado de seguridad del pa\u00eds dice que Telegram no quit\u00f3 videos de tiroteos masivos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Telegram y Videos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"People are being warned to stay alert due to possible earthquake aftershocks that could reach magnitude 7.\",            \"english_title\": \"Earthquake Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"Se advierte a la gente que est\u00e9 alerta por posibles r\u00e9plicas de terremoto que podr\u00edan llegar a magnitud 7.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia de Terremoto\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The actor and musician is facing accusations from 10 women who claim he mistreated them when they were teenagers.\",            \"english_title\": \"Accusations Against Actor\",            \"translated_version\": \"El actor y m\u00fasico enfrenta acusaciones de 10 mujeres que dicen que las trat\u00f3 mal cuando eran adolescentes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Acusaciones Contra Actor\"        }    ]}"